<h3>Starting Spectrum</h3>

<p>The starting spectrum may be choosen among the spectra listed here.  

<p>The MAXIET algorithm may be choosen.
<br>An individual starting spectrum may be choosen.
<br>Or a search for the best starting spectrum may be done.  This does not include the MAXIET algorithm.

<p>In the future the user will be able to input their own starting spectrum.
